Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.81,0:32:49.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0008,,{\an8}{\blur3}您好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How are you?


Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.12,0:32:51.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0008,,{\an8}{\blur3}很好 我的小东西 你呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good, my little baby. How about you?


Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.86,0:32:53.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0008,,{\an8}{\blur3}还不错啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.20,0:01:33.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下驾到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His majesty,the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.25,0:01:47.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲爱的妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My dear sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.07,0:01:53.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝你一路顺风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fare you well on your journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:58.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}记住 葡萄牙国王 你未来的丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Remember the king of portugal, your future husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:02:00.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他爱你 尊敬你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}loves and respects you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.94,0:02:03.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你必须同样爱他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must love him in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.33,0:02:12.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}记住你的承诺 他死之后 我要嫁我中意的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Remember your promise! When he dies, I marry whom I choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.67,0:02:21.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}查尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.59,0:02:25.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如同你爱我般照顾好她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you love me, take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.66,0:02:28.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会 请您安心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will. You may have no doubts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.80,0:02:30.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会视其为自己生妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall treat her as if she were my own sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.88,0:02:42.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝与你们同在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God be with all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.81,0:02:44.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}牢记你们的职责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And remember your duties,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.64,0:02:47.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对我王妹 对英格兰的职责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to my lady and to england.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.35,0:02:50.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一同祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us pray.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.59,0:03:06.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教皇感谢上帝赐予我们一位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His holiness thanked god for raising up such a prince
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.43,0:03:08.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如此忠于礼教的王子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to be a champion of the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.25,0:03:12.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他震撼于您肯花时间撰写这本书册\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He expressed astonishment that you'd found time to write the pamphlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.67,0:03:15.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另外 为了表示他的感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Furthermore,in order to show his gratitude
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.59,0:03:18.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教皇决定给您冠上新头衔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the pope has decided to honour you with a new title:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.93,0:03:22.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}护教者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fidei defensor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.66,0:03:24.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}护教者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fidei defensor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:28.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}信念的守护者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Defender of the faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:32.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但陛下您需知晓 马丁-路德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But your majesty should know that martin luther
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.04,0:03:34.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也对您的书册做出了回应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has also responded to your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.45,0:03:37.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他说什么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.49,0:03:40.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他谴责您是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well he accuses you of...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.09,0:03:43.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.48,0:03:48.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他谴责您像个撒泼的妓女般咆哮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He accuses you of raving like a strumpet in a tantrum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.18,0:03:49.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么 ？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.17,0:03:54.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他说 若英格兰国王让他自己 能堂堂地滥吼谬误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He says if the king of england gives himself the right to spew out falsehoods,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.05,0:03:57.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么他就能让我堂堂地 把谬误塞回他喉咙里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}then he gives me the right to stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.21,0:03:59.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他该被烧死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He ought to be burned!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.84,0:04:07.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}动手拉绳子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give me a hand with these ropes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.06,0:04:12.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是您的特等舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is your stateroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.37,0:04:14.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望得到殿下您的满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hope it meets with your highness's approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.46,0:04:17.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}凑合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It'll serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.50,0:04:20.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}床不宽 但够用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The bed is narrow but adequate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.58,0:04:22.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有大状况 这些板子不会移动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the case of action all this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.25,0:04:24.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}状况？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Action?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.45,0:04:25.93,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}万一我们遭受袭击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we are attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.93,0:04:27.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁会袭击我们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who will attack us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.68,0:04:29.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}海盗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.22,0:04:32.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我看来 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It seems to me, your grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.63,0:04:36.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比起海盗 更需要我们提防的人已经在船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we have more to fear from the pirates already onboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.81,0:05:03.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早安 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good morning,madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.04,0:05:05.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.18,0:06:03.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.82,0:06:07.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安… 克利福德女士来访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}lady anne... clifford.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.98,0:06:24.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:06:58.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}(致国王陛下)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.42,0:07:08.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}高贵的陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your gracious majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.33,0:07:12.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}退还您相赠礼物 使我无比痛心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It causes me such pain and grief to return the gifts you gave
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:17.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 如此精美饰物 岂我能相配…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Alas,they are too beautiful and I unworthy to receive them...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.62,0:07:21.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我应不曾让陛下有馈赠之理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think I never gave your majesty cause to give them to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.72,0:07:25.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我如此微不足道 而您却如此举足轻重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}since I am nothing and you are everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.23,0:07:30.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恳请您 将此华饰 赠予应得陛下宠幸之人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give them,I pray you, to a lady more deserving of your majesty's affections.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.99,0:07:34.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我正离宫前往西弗的家中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am leaving now for my family's house at hever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.85,0:07:38.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会一路挂念着您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall think of you on the journey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.79,0:07:42.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您忠实的仆人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your loving servant,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.44,0:07:45.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安-博林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}anne boleyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.39,0:07:57.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伦敦塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}TOWER OF LONDON
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.26,0:08:02.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}佩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.48,0:08:04.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有何能为您效劳 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At your service,sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.19,0:08:06.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您被释放了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are to be released.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.65,0:08:08.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我什么都不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.16,0:08:11.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么意思？我说您被释放了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's that? I said,you're to be released.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.77,0:08:13.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我告诉过妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I told my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.47,0:08:16.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说 我不知道 什么都不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I said: I don't know anything. Anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.84,0:08:21.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您告诉过您妻子 佩斯先生？什么时候？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You,told your wife, mr. Pace? When?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.28,0:08:23.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嘘…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.25,0:08:26.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她睡着了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}she's sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.14,0:08:30.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们谈天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We talk together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.36,0:08:34.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以为她死于儿子的难产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought she had died when she gave birth to our son.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.67,0:08:37.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我肯定我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was sure I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.43,0:08:40.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我去了葬礼 还哭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I went to the funeral,and wept.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.95,0:08:45.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可现在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But now...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.86,0:08:49.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看见她如同我一般\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I see she's alive
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.05,0:08:51.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}依旧存活在这个世界里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and as well as I.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.84,0:08:58.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看不到她？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you not see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.93,0:09:08.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看到 佩斯先生 我能看到她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,mr. Pace. I see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.59,0:09:29.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克伦威尔先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Cromwell!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.19,0:09:32.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.75,0:09:34.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我注意到你很久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have long noticed your
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.82,0:09:38.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你工作上天资聪颖 落实我交办之事也十分勤奋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}aptitude for work and your diligence in carrying through my affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.77,0:09:41.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有你的判断力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And your discretion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.72,0:09:44.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}感谢阁下如此器重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am grateful to your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.19,0:09:47.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你出身低微\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are of obscure stock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.18,0:09:50.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与我一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But then so am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.16,0:09:53.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但这不足以成为你的牵绊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It should not be held against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.38,0:09:58.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我手上可能有份适合你的职务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I may have a proposition to put to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.15,0:10:02.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 主教阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you,your eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:09.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}根据我国与罗马皇帝的协议条款\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By the terms of our treaty with the emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.49,0:10:12.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们有责任为他提供战争经济援助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we are obliged to support his war effort financially.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.63,0:10:15.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}目前他的军队在意大利和法军交战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At present his armies are fighting the french in italy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.59,0:10:17.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}米兰附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Near milan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.13,0:10:20.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不幸的是 我计算过 为了达成我方义务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unfortunately,I have calculated that in order to meet our obligations
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.43,0:10:24.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只能提高税收\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we shall be obliged to raise taxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.05,0:10:28.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赠税议案将在下次议会上提出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A bill will be presented to parliament at the next session.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.66,0:10:30.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好 行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.08,0:10:32.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有信心 议案会顺利通过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I trust the bill will pass successfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.67,0:10:36.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我确信 一切都尽在主教大人您的掌握中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm sure,your eminence,with your guiding hand it will be so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.90,0:10:40.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至少 我们和罗马皇帝的联盟 受到如此的拥戴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At least our alliance with the emperor is popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:44.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管有时我自问 为何会如此呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Although I sometimes ask myself, why that should be so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.72,0:10:47.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为他不是法国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because he's not french!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.88,0:10:49.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.53,0:10:54.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}新战舰已经委托给朴次茅斯港铸造\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The new warship is commissioned at portsmouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.81,0:10:56.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mm hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.91,0:11:00.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}忘了跟您说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I forgot to mention to your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.97,0:11:05.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宫中新来一位访客 纳瓦拉的玛格丽特公主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have a new visitor at court, princess marguerrite of navarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.25,0:11:08.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}昨日我亲自接待的她 是位十分美丽的年轻少妇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I received her myself yesterday. I found her a very beautiful young woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.30,0:11:12.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}脾性甜美而顺从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with a very sweet, and yielding,disposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.62,0:11:16.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她表明了对陛下您的仰慕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She confessed a great admiration for your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.89,0:11:18.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是否要安排…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Should I arrange...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.41,0:11:21.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是 是的 安排吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes. Yes do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.45,0:11:25.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下已经应允我的 我想要指派一位新秘书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With your majesty's permission, I intend to appoint a new secretary,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.85,0:11:27.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}代替佩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}instead of mr. Pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.69,0:11:29.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.93,0:11:40.59,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}咱们到里斯本寻欢作乐吧 兄弟们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We're gonna have fun in lisbon,boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.72,0:11:43.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那儿的妓女可是全世界最棒的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The whores are the best in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.83,0:11:46.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就算她们说的你一个字都不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even if you can't understand a word they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.25,0:11:47.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她们不跟我说话的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They don't talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.80,0:11:49.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她们嘴里都满着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They always have their mouths full!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.86,0:11:55.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看看 大人 我的王压了你的后 (扑克牌的K和Q)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There you are,your grace. My king has your queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.64,0:12:01.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我比较希望压王后的是小鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well,I was rather hoping that the knave would get the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.44,0:12:23.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Eminence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.68,0:12:25.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:30.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}允许我介绍纳瓦拉的玛格丽特公主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I present princess marguerrite of navarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.99,0:12:33.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madame.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.27,0:12:34.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majeste.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:36.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是来做客的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are visiting here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.24,0:12:40.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的陛下 伯爵… 我丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oui,majeste. The count,my husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.73,0:12:44.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有事留在法国无法同来 很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}had to stay behind in france,regrettably.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.28,0:12:47.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的确 非常遗憾 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed. Very regrettable,madame.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.70,0:12:50.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会得到补偿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you must be compensated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.37,0:12:54.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这里你一定会享受到乐趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must enjoy some pleasures whilst here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:17.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有个消息 大人也许会感兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have some news, which may interest your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.77,0:13:21.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}温彻斯特的主教6个月前逝世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The bishop of winchester died 6 months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.32,0:13:22.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mm hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.98,0:13:26.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}温彻斯特是英格兰最富有的教区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Winchester is the richest parish in england.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.17,0:13:29.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沃尔西本该委任其继任人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wolsey is supposed to appoint his successor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.47,0:13:31.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且他已经提出任命者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And he just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.22,0:13:33.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是他自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He appointed himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.86,0:13:36.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那男人到底想要多少财富？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How much more wealth does that man want?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.21,0:13:38.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 还有更多 - 告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}-  There's more. -  Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.65,0:13:40.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}似乎他正用国王的部分钱财\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It appears that he's been using some of the king's money
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.83,0:13:42.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为他在牛津的新学院投资\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to invest his new college in oxford,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.57,0:13:45.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有他私人的基金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and his own personal foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.88,0:13:49.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他关闭最不景气的修道院 剥夺它们全部资产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He closes down the worst monasteries, strips them of their assets,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:50.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么做是应该的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as he is supposed to do
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.45,0:13:54.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但这些收益 并没有流入国王的小金库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but instead of transferring all the profit to the privy purse
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.07,0:13:56.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而是全部不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he makes all the profits disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.11,0:13:59.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝 你必须告知国王 马上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}God. You must tell the king. Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.57,0:14:01.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请原谅 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Forgive me,your grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.24,0:14:04.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我们得审时度势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but we must judge the time,exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.19,0:14:07.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沃尔西已是国王心腹 无论证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Such is wolsey's hold over the king that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.54,0:14:09.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如何不利于他 国王都不会相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whatever the evidence against him,the king won't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:11.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但总会有时机出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But there will come a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.65,0:14:17.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当国王对这位大臣的信任 悬置未决的时候 大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When the king's belief in his minister will hang in the balance and then,your grace
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.20,0:14:20.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们就能把真相抖落到天平上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we shall drop our truth into the scales
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.25,0:14:23.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天平就会倾斜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the scales will fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.78,0:14:29.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的托马斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dear thomas!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.62,0:14:36.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.65,0:14:41.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}留在宫里 我需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come and stay at court. I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.06,0:14:43.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我给你华丽的住所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll give you great chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.05,0:14:45.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}康普顿的住所很好的 给你用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Compton has great chambers. You can have his!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.37,0:14:50.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如同我爱陛下您一般 我希望住所中能有我的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Much as I love your majesty, I like my chambers to have my family inside them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.07,0:14:52.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.40,0:15:01.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下钟爱你胜过任何人 摩尔先生 您知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His majesty loves you above anyone else, mr. More,you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.69,0:15:03.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That may be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.79,0:15:07.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但 若我的人头 能为他换来西班牙的一座城堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet,if my head were to win him a castle in spain,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.21,0:15:10.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想他会砍下来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think he would cut it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.78,0:15:19.40,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怀亚特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Wyatt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.03,0:15:23.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.23,0:15:25.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听说你是位诗人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hear you're a poet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.03,0:15:28.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 我写诗 但不知道算不算诗人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh. I write poems. I don't know how to be "a poet. "
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.26,0:15:31.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我略有欣赏 很得我欢欣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've read some. I like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.05,0:15:34.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 我感激无言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lord,I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.58,0:15:39.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你爱着安-博林？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Were you in love with anne boleyn?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.56,0:15:41.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.47,0:15:44.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沃尔西主教告诉我 你们曾有婚约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}cardinal wolsey tells me you were once engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.36,0:15:46.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 并非如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No! That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.75,0:15:49.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你爱过她？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you love her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.60,0:15:56.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安女士如此美丽 任何男人都有责任爱她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lady anne is so beautiful it is the duty of every man to love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.26,0:16:00.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我当然爱过她 但只是暗恋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course I loved her but from a distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.46,0:16:03.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而我本人是有妇之夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Personally,I have a wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.42,0:16:09.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吃好喝好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Enjoy the feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.03,0:16:29.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯？托马斯-塔利斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thomas? Thomas tallis!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.41,0:16:30.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.54,0:16:34.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们只想说 我们爱你的音乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We just wanted to say we love your music.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.02,0:16:36.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.93,0:16:40.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我俩同房 你想跟我们回去吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We share a room. Do you want to come back with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.31,0:16:46.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想把这首曲子作完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want to finish this song.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.10,0:16:47.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明天再写\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But finish it tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.73,0:16:50.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明天就会忘掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll have forgotten it by tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.13,0:16:53.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也会忘掉我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you'll forget us,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.54,0:17:14.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}康普顿 我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Compton,my friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.27,0:17:17.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}觉得纳瓦拉的玛格丽特公主如何？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}what do you think of princess marguerrite de navarre?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.51,0:17:27.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天生尤物 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's well built your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.95,0:17:30.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过照我的喜好 上围稍重了些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Little heavy in the top decks for my taste though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.60,0:17:35.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她是弗朗西斯的妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She's francis' sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.49,0:17:37.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}碰巧让我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I happen to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.35,0:17:39.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯哼…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mm hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.25,0:17:50.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}oh,majeste.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:55.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah,majeste.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.14,0:18:00.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}喔 啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ouu,ahh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.29,0:18:03.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 哦 我的天 亨利 - 我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}-  Ah,mon dieu,henri. -  Mon dieu,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.27,0:18:05.64,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亨利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}henri.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.75,0:18:13.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}完事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}C'est fini.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.14,0:18:17.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}何时何地我都乐意赢你的钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Happy to take your money anytime or place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.96,0:18:20.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}船长 你该省点钱到里斯本用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You should save your money captain, for when we get to lisbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.49,0:18:23.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.16,0:18:54.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.11,0:18:58.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让开 让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make way. Make way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.27,0:19:04.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}罗马皇帝的信史到 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A messenger from the emperor, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.74,0:19:08.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么了？出什么事了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well?! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.38,0:19:11.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皇帝陛下大胜法军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The emperor has won a great victory against the french.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.29,0:19:12.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的意思是？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.63,0:19:14.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}五天前 在帕维亚战役大获全胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At the battle of pavia, 5 days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.87,0:19:17.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}皇帝的军队完全占据上风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the emperor's army totally overcame those of the french.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.96,0:19:20.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法军已溃不成军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The french army was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.67,0:19:25.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My god!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.21,0:19:27.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所言属实？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is this true?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.57,0:19:32.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不止如此 法兰西国王本身 亦在战场就擒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not only that! The french king himself was also captured on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.57,0:19:37.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Francis?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.57,0:19:39.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯国王被擒？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}King francis was captured?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.62,0:19:41.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.36,0:19:43.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他现为皇帝的阶下囚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's now the emperor's prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.54,0:19:51.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的到来好比天使长加百列降临\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are as welcome here as the angel gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.80,0:19:53.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去吃饱吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Feed yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.47,0:19:55.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}喜讯到来 庆祝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Great news! We must celebrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.68,0:19:57.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.11,0:20:08.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.13,0:20:11.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安东尼-耐弗特先生得分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Point to mr. Anthony knivert!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.71,0:20:13.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}干得好 托尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well done,tony!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.31,0:20:16.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉你 威廉 我今天一定会被加封骑士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I tell you,william. I will be called a knight today,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.56,0:20:18.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不然就永远不会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or I never will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.16,0:20:21.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下迎战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His majesty,the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.08,0:20:35.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.65,0:20:37.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.28,0:20:49.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 为国王陛下欢呼 - 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}-  Hoorah for his majesty! -  My lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.60,0:20:55.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝您胜利 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Godspeed,your majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.23,0:21:02.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也看到皇后多么受人爱戴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You see how popular the queen is with the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.38,0:21:05.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她是易莎贝拉和费德南的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She is the daughter of isabela and ferdinand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.80,0:21:11.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许人们认为皇后就该像她这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps the people think she is what a queen ought to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.86,0:21:16.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威廉-康普顿先生接受陛下的挑战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. William compton takes his majesty's challenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.39,0:21:22.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您今天看来有些许不悦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You seem out of sorts today.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.86,0:21:26.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我自有沮丧和痛苦的理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have reasons to be downcast and pained.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.29,0:21:28.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但那些沮丧和痛苦并不让你困扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But they needn't bother you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.44,0:21:30.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么我们不该承受痛苦？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why should we not have pains?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.60,0:21:34.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有些人认为我们该享受于天堂的羽绒暖床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some people think we ought to go to heaven in feather beds!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.43,0:21:37.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是不该那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But that is not the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.68,0:21:42.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的主升天时被痛苦和磨难缠身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The lord himself went there in pain and tribulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.30,0:21:48.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 我并不是说您是那样…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not that I'm suggesting that you're like that. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.60,0:21:55.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您准备好了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.14,0:21:57.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我生来就已准备好 威廉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I was born ready william.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.13,0:22:16.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}进攻得分 国王陛下得分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Attack! A point for his majesty the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.67,0:22:18.65,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要看我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.65,0:22:21.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我请求你私下替我做件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ask you privately to do something for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.70,0:22:24.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将这封信带给皇帝殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take this letter to the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.02,0:22:26.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能替我完成这件任务吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will do this for me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.86,0:22:29.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不得将此信给他人看 也不得同他人提及只言半语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and not show it to anyone nor speak a word about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.52,0:22:31.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再一局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.81,0:22:43.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}进攻得分 国王陛下赢得两分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Attack! Two points for his majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.90,0:22:53.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"你不肯接受这些珠宝让我暗自忧伤"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}"I was distressed you would not accept the brooches.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.69,0:22:56.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"这些珠宝并非为她人 而专门为你而铸"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They were made for you, not for anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.76,0:23:00.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"为何我视你如珍宝 你却自认渺小"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And why are you not worthy when I deem you so?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.09,0:23:01.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"对汝芳心的渴望… "\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For certain,it must be plain to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.84,0:23:04.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"在你看来一定微不足道"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}now that I desire to find a place in your heart."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.28,0:23:07.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等等 给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}wait! Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.10,0:23:11.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.83,0:23:20.09,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对汝芳心的渴望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Desire to find a place in your heart
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.09,0:23:23.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及对你深爱的向往\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and your grounded affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.08,0:23:25.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}深爱？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Grounded affection?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.00,0:23:27.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}深爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Grounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.75,0:23:30.80,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟我说你们私下见过面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell me at least that we can meet in private.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.80,0:23:33.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"能够与你倾心比什么都重要"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I mean nothing more than a chance to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.17,0:23:37.27,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"我恳求你 快速回宫"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I beg you, come back to court soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.27,0:23:38.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快点还给我 哥哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come... give it back,brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.70,0:23:39.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与此同时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And meanwhile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.14,0:23:41.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看在上帝的份上 请接受这份礼物 并让其有幸被佩戴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}accept this new gift and wear it,for my sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.29,0:23:44.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么礼物 在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What gift? And where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.28,0:23:50.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 老天爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh holy jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.23,0:23:59.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拿过来 小伙子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bring it here,lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.91,0:24:23.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你什么时候带我的外甥女回宫？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When will you bring my niece back to court?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.85,0:24:25.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看就快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Soon,I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.15,0:24:28.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 国王的胃口被吊起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now the king's appetite is whetted.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.95,0:24:39.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.27,0:24:44.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小把戏而已 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just a trick,your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.20,0:24:46.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小把戏而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.34,0:24:52.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王陛下 对战 安东尼-耐弗特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His majesty,the king and mr. Anthony knivert!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.76,0:24:54.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 长枪 - 就绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Lance. - A plaisance!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.58,0:24:56.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}准备好了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ready?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.19,0:24:57.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}长枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lance.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.52,0:25:01.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}冲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.46,0:25:05.45,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王忘记扣下面罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The king's forgotten his visor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.11,0:25:09.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坚持住 坚持住 国王陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold! Hold! Hold! The king! The king! Hold!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.19,0:25:25.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty! Your majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.53,0:25:34.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 我没受伤 - 让我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- I'm not hurt! - Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.31,0:25:36.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 没有伤到眼睛 感谢上帝 - 给我一块手帕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- It's not your eyes,thank god. -  A cloth to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.68,0:25:39.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.36,0:25:45.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看 看到了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See! See?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.23,0:25:49.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.79,0:25:51.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您能原谅我吗？您能原谅我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will you forgive me? Will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.69,0:25:54.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那不是你的错 安东尼 不是你的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not your fault anthony! It's all my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.69,0:25:57.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是我的错 你伤不到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's my fault! You didn't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.06,0:25:59.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你伤不到我 - 我不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- You can't hurt me. -  No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.00,0:26:01.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再战一局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Try it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.88,0:26:05.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亨利 亨利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Henry. Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.32,0:26:08.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人 不要惊慌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Madam, have no fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.85,0:26:11.72,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要再次跨上战马 证明给这里所有的人看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I intend to ride again and prove to everyone here
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.72,0:26:13.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我刀枪不入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that I'm well and unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.19,0:26:16.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果您坚持… 但我宁愿您改变主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you insist,but I would much rather you did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.59,0:26:23.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.60,0:26:26.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}戴好盔甲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Arm yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.21,0:26:28.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.54,0:26:46.03,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}准备迎接我的挑战吗 安东尼？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you ready for me anthony?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.37,0:26:57.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}英格兰人民 你们的国王平安无事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}People of england, your king is unharmed!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.07,0:27:23.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}长枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lance!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.11,0:27:57.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有呼吸吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is he breathing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.58,0:28:01.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叫医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get a physic!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.55,0:28:04.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}耐弗特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Knivert!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.77,0:28:07.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安东尼 安东尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anthony! Anthony.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.42,0:28:25.54,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您召见我 殿下？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You want to see me, your highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.02,0:28:28.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是问问还得在海上多久？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only to ask how much longer we must be at sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.34,0:28:31.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}顺风的话 再两天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With a fair wind,2 more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.40,0:28:36.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你玩牌吗 大人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you play cards,your grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.37,0:28:40.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有时… 殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sometimes... your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.64,0:28:43.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们玩什么好？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What game shall we play?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.45,0:28:48.50,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}悉听尊便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.25,0:28:52.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}法式出王牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}French ruff.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.82,0:29:03.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你来抽王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You pick trumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.55,0:29:07.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王(扑克牌的K)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.68,0:29:10.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}手气好而已 殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How appropriate your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.60,0:29:13.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要酒吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.17,0:29:16.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}随您意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.60,0:29:32.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}殿下对您的婚礼一定很期待吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your highness must be looking forward with great anticipation to your wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.88,0:29:37.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我听说对方国王骑术了得…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hear the king was a great horseman...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.19,0:29:40.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在他在位时期 还因美丽的情人们著名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in his time. And famous for his beautiful mistresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.70,0:29:42.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要揶揄我 我不喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't tease me. I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.20,0:29:46.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个老男人试图跟您做爱时 您喜欢吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Will you like it when an old man tries to make love to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.47,0:29:51.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大人这话说太过了 已经\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your grace goes too far. Already.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.11,0:29:54.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福音书说 真相让人自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gospel says the truth will make you free.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.61,0:29:57.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在你渎神了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now you are blasphemous!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.01,0:29:59.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可怜的女士们不该听到你的言语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My poor ladies should not hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.58,0:30:03.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.19,0:30:05.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 夫人 - 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}-  My lady. -  My lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.08,0:30:22.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要你离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want you to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.88,0:30:24.97,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.69,0:30:29.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对 现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.95,0:30:32.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.04,0:30:35.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我手气正好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had a winning hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.32,0:31:51.30,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给皇帝传信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Send a message to the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.30,0:31:54.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉他我们对他在帕维亚的大胜 还有法兰西国王擒住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell him of our joy and contentment at his great victory at pavia,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.29,0:31:57.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是多么喜悦和欢欣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and his capture of the french king.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.11,0:31:58.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.53,0:32:00.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}问他准备如何处置弗朗西斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ask him what he intends to do with francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.96,0:32:02.75,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有既然俘虏了弗朗西斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And whether or not, with francis captive,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.75,0:32:06.19,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是否现在 并非攻打法国本土的好时机？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it may not be a good time to think about striking france itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.60,0:32:10.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉他我们有黄金 人力和战船 任之利用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tell him we have gold, men and ships at his disposal,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.25,0:32:14.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们急切希望参战 共享他的荣誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and are eager to do battle and share some of his glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.29,0:32:15.70,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谨遵吩咐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,I shall.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.70,0:32:18.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 陛下 这位是您的新秘书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah! Your majesty. This is your new secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.29,0:32:23.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托马斯-克伦威尔 训练有素的律师 勤勉的人 一位学者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is thomas cromwell. He is a trained barrister, a diligent man and a scholar.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.00,0:32:25.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他将会对陛下您效力非凡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I think he'll be very useful for your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.78,0:32:29.79,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 克伦威尔先生 - 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Mr. Cromwell. - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.25,0:32:35.86,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}女士们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.59,0:32:40.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你回宫了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You're back at court.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.63,0:32:43.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}私下见面好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I see you privately?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.19,0:32:45.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.85,0:32:47.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}父王 父王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Le roi! Le roi!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.64,0:33:00.48,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.53,0:33:09.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沃尔西为什么拆我的信？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why does wolsey open my letters?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.85,0:33:12.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我难道不是英格兰的王后？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Am I not the queen of england?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.57,0:33:14.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 你确定他拆了？ - 确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}-  You sure he does? -  I am sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.95,0:33:18.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么我会阻止他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then I shall stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.63,0:33:27.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沃尔西主教有时热心过头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cardinal wolsey can be too zealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.20,0:33:30.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但永远都在为我们的利益效力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But it is always in our interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.54,0:33:42.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除非你藏了什么秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unless you have secrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.19,0:33:49.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安东尼-耐弗特先生到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. Anthony knivert.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.59,0:33:52.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安东尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anthony.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.63,0:33:54.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.93,0:34:02.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你差点儿瞎了一只眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You almost lost an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.69,0:34:04.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}反正那只也不太用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Never use that one much anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.70,0:34:08.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kneel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.01,0:34:18.29,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我封你为安东尼-耐弗特爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I dub thee sir anthony knivert.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.93,0:34:22.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请起 安东尼爵士 接受公证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Arise sir anthony and be recognized.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.33,0:34:28.78,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威廉·康普顿先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mr. William compton.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.10,0:34:36.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这责难的眼神是为什么 安东尼爵士？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why so reproving a look,sir anthony?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.43,0:34:39.60,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下 我为同样的称誉 几乎失去一只眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty,I nearly lost an eye for the same report.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.60,0:34:43.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 可你没有搬过树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah! But you never carried a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.20,0:34:47.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威廉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}William!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.09,0:34:52.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kneel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.70,0:34:56.49,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此 我们都要清楚 那个教皇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So that is why it is to be understood that the pope,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.49,0:34:58.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没资格算圣彼得的后裔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}far from being a descendant of st. Peter,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.84,0:35:03.12,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是个罪人 伪君子 是恶魔忠心的奴仆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}is a sinner,a hypocrite, a handmaiden to the devil,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.12,0:35:05.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说到底 是活生生的反基督者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the living anti-christ on earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.96,0:35:08.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是路德教导我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is what luther teaches us,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.85,0:35:13.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了让我们从错误的崇拜 和虚假的神灵中脱身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in order to free us from false worship and false idols.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.93,0:35:17.38,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了让我们回归真正的宗教\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In order that we might return to the true religion
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.38,0:35:20.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走上结满真理果实的道路 直达救赎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and take the true and fruitful path to salvation!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.81,0:35:22.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的讯息 关于希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our message of hope,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.81,0:35:26.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关于自由 关于真理 已经在欧洲蔓延开来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of liberty,of truth is already spreading throughout europe,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.51,0:35:28.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}传遍每个角落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}from one corner to the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.06,0:35:30.18,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这里 在英格兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here in england,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.18,0:35:32.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们已撒下一粒种子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we have planted a seed
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.14,0:35:36.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它将会 伴随祈祷 伴随行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that will, with prayer,with action,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.67,0:35:39.24,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许还伴随牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and perhaps even with sacrifice,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.24,0:35:42.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}总有一天长成参天大树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}grow one day to become a great tree
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.33,0:35:44.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它的枝条将覆盖整个王国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whose branches will over-reach the kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.35,0:35:48.23,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}摧毁所有反基督的腐烂的修道院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and destroy the putrid monastic houses of the anti-christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.46,0:35:54.35,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而这棵树…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And this tree...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.35,0:35:57.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这棵树将被命名自由之树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}this tree will be called the liberty tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.43,0:36:02.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我主之天使将在其枝头歌唱…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in its branches all the angels of the lord will sing...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.93,0:36:05.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 哈利路亚 - 哈利路亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}-  hallelujah. -  Hallelujah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.31,0:36:09.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈利路亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hallelujah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.19,0:36:30.52,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我梦想这一刻很久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have dreamt of this moment a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.15,0:36:32.96,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Anne,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.96,0:36:36.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要知道 我整颗心都渴望着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}you must know I desire you with all my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.84,0:36:50.47,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}刚才跟你调情的年轻男子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The young man you were dallying with earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.47,0:36:53.05,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.05,0:36:56.13,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我哥哥乔治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My brother george.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.77,0:37:10.69,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}王后陛下在等我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Her majesty expects me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.69,0:37:13.21,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.81,0:37:19.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是谁 陛下？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who was that, your majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.22,0:37:25.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.07,0:37:52.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您的新王国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your new kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.22,0:37:57.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}国王一定很期待…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The king must be looking forward...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.08,0:38:00.68,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别 不许说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}don't! I forbid you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.11,0:38:06.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我本该恨你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I should hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.49,0:38:10.73,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但你不恨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But you don'T.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.64,0:38:14.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道你不恨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know you don'T.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.59,0:38:24.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我该怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What will I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.28,0:38:30.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}里斯本皇宫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}ROYAL PALACE LISBON
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.17,0:39:05.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.94,0:39:15.66,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛格丽特…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Margaret...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.31,0:39:21.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你比画像上更漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}YOU ARE EVEN MORE HANDSOME THAN YOUR PORTRAIT.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.92,0:39:24.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我太幸运了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I FEEL SO GREATLY FORTUNATE,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.95,0:39:29.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你即将成为我的王后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}THAT YOU ARE SOON TO BE MY QUEEN.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.84,0:39:33.87,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里的一切都是你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}EVERTHING HERE IS AT YOUR DISPOSAL.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.07,0:39:37.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只要你开心就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I ONLY WANT YOU TO BE HAPPY.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.05,0:39:39.76,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有让我开心就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}AND TO MAKE ME HAPPY.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.12,0:39:46.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后在上帝的帮助下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}AND THEN WE WILL MAKE CHILDREN,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.35,0:39:50.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们会生很多孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}MANY CHILDREN...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.22,0:39:52.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}子女满堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}WITH GODS HELP!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.67,0:41:34.26,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.26,0:41:36.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}执行国王的吩咐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What the king ordered!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.04,0:42:44.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许你不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.22,0:42:46.43,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我无法入眠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I can't sleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.05,0:42:49.34,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}单单想到你 我便无法呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can hardly breathe, for thinking of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.19,0:42:54.89,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每个醒着的时刻 你的样子总浮现我眼前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your image is before my eyes every waking second.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.20,0:42:58.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我几乎要相信 自己会牺牲掉我的王国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I almost believe that I would
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.29,0:43:01.56,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只求在你怀中一小时…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for an hour in your arms...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.79,0:43:03.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I beg you,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.87,0:43:06.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给我一个能见面的地点 时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}name some place that we can meet,and when
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.94,0:43:11.32,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我证明我对你的真爱 是超越一般爱情的挚爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}where I can show you truly an affection which is beyond a common affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.56,0:43:16.01,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的仆人 亨利 亲笔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Written with the hand of your servant,henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.65,0:43:21.88,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在他成了你的仆人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now he is your servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.39,0:43:26.04,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加上些微妙关心和你肉体的诱惑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With some subtle care and the lure of your flesh,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.46,0:43:28.95,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他能成为更亲近的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he may become something even closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.15,0:44:53.57,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.62,0:45:44.63,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下是否…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did his majesty...?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.75,0:46:18.07,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}留步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hold!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.93,0:46:22.85,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.86,0:46:25.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沼泽太宽 我们得绕道而行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ground's too boggy. We're gonna have to go around.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.55,0:46:27.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁说的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Says who?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.63,0:46:29.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们跳不过这道沟的 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We can't jump this ditch,your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.27,0:46:32.92,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是你们跳不过这道沟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You mean you can't jump this ditch.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.28,0:46:43.41,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}旗杆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Flag pole!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.98,0:46:48.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.39,0:46:50.00,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 安东尼爵士？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,sir anthony?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.00,0:46:52.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您要做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.44,0:46:55.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要跨越这条蠢沟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm going to vault this stupid ditch.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.10,0:46:58.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有任何东西能成为我和我矫健之躯的阻扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing stands in the way of me and my sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.56,0:47:00.83,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您确定？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.15,0:47:04.51,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给你们看看英格兰国王的能耐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Just watch and see what the king of england can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.77,0:47:14.17,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.07,0:47:27.31,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.59,0:47:52.15,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}找医生来 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fetch a physician! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.78,0:48:11.98,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如蒙陛下恩准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With your majesty's permission,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.98,0:48:14.55,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可否与您妻子共舞一曲？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}may I dance with your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.08,0:48:41.16,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你什么时候走？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When do you leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.55,0:48:43.28,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.29,0:48:51.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You can'T.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.93,0:48:54.42,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么不行？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why can't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.42,0:48:56.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已功成圆满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've discharged my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.67,0:48:59.82,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我为什么要留下？你还有你的日子要过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why should I stay? You have a life to lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.34,0:49:16.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.08,0:49:18.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有些人看上去健康无比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Some men who seem at the peak of health,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.37,0:49:22.25,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正值青年 充满活力 却突然倒下死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who still are young and full of life suddenly collapse and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.69,0:49:26.46,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同样奇怪的 有些老人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By that same counter, some old men,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.46,0:49:30.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看上去身体已经老旧 了无生气…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}whose bodies look worn out, whose race seems run...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.37,0:49:32.81,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们还能撑上几年呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}they can go on for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.81,0:49:35.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不觉得奇怪吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't you think it's strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.96,0:49:40.33,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这样奚落我 是因为好玩？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you tease me because it amuses you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.33,0:49:42.53,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不然为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why else?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.56,0:49:54.11,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为你爱我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because you love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.53,0:50:23.22,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.98,0:50:29.39,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.39,0:50:32.91,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们要给您放血 就放少许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We would like to bleed you,a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.91,0:50:37.67,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让那些使您痛苦不堪的胆汁流走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To drain away the bile which is causing your majesty so much pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.59,0:50:41.94,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您是否允许？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With your permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.57,0:50:48.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.79,0:52:09.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我差点死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I almost died.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.29,0:52:11.10,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes,your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.10,0:52:15.20,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去你的"是 陛下" 我差点死了 听不懂啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No not "yes,your majesty. " I almost died! Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.67,0:52:28.44,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从那刻起 我想了很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Since that moment,I've done a great deal of thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.55,0:52:31.99,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}万一我真的死了怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What if I had died?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.63,0:52:34.37,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我都留下什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What would I have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.97,0:52:40.62,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有子嗣 只有一个女儿 和一个杂种儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have no heir only a daughter and a bastard son.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.60,0:52:44.58,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明白吗 沃尔西？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You understand,wolsey?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.58,0:52:47.61,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都铎王朝… 完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The tudor dynasty... gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.61,0:52:52.06,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我父王的成就 全完了 且是因为我的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All my father's work,finished! And it's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.91,0:52:58.14,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我过了太久享乐的日子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have lived too long for pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.19,0:53:02.08,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从来未打算过未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never even thought of the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.59,0:53:10.71,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我娶了亡兄的妻子 上帝已经惩罚了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I married my brother's wife and god has punished me!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.37,0:53:19.02,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我如此愚蠢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've been such a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.19,0:53:31.77,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在一切都变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now everything has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.90,0:53:36.74,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.79,0:53:42.84,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要离婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I want a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.31,0:53:48.36,中上英下,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你来筹备一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you will get one for me.
